    "content": "For Tax Day 2026 (April 15), several restaurants are offering deals, including BOGO footlongs at Subway (code: FLBOGO), a $10.40 special at Grimaldi's, and free doughnuts at Krispy Kreme with a dozen purchase. Other deals include $10 off $40 at BJ’s, $3 burgers at Checkers/Rally's, and various BOGO offers at Potbelly, Fazoli’s, and Buca di Beppo.Tax Day 2026 Food Deals & Discounts (April 15)Subway: Rewards members get a free footlong with the purchase of another using code FLBOGO on the app/website.Krispy Kreme: Buy any dozen doughnuts, get an Original Glazed dozen for free in-shop, drive-thru, or online.Pizza Hut: Large 3-topping pizzas start at $10 for limited time at participating locations.BJ’s Restaurant & Brewhouse: $10 off orders of $40 or more for dine-in, takeout, or delivery.Hooters: $4.15 select appetizers/burgers, $2.50 American drafts, and free kids' meals with adult entree.Popeyes: 25% off the 3-piece tender combo on the app or website.Potbelly: Buy one original sandwich or wrap, get one free via the app/website with code BOGO.White Castle: 15% off orders with code WC15OFF through April 17.Kona Ice: Free shaved ice at participating trucks.Qdoba: Rewards members get $5 off a full-sized entree if they complete a survey on \"Guac Relief\" by April 15, valid later.Checkers & Rally’s: $3 Big Buford burger on April 14 and 15.Paris Baguette: PB Rewards members get a free pastry with any beverage purchase.Dickey's Barbecue Pit: $10 off orders of $50 or more with code WRITEOFF.Penn Station East Coast Subs: Small sub for $5.99 with code TAX26.Smoothie King: $3 off for new Healthy Rewards members.Sonny's BBQ: $10.99 St. Louis Rib Dinner.Taco John’s: Free small Potato Olés with a $3+ purchase.Church’s Texas Chicken: 8-piece leg & thigh for $4.99 for rewards members.Round Table Pizza: 15% off with code RTP978 (April 15-19).7-Eleven: $10.40 off orders of $25+ on the 7NOW app with code WRITEOFF.Most deals are valid on April 15, 2026, only and participating locations may vary.",
